{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01461TjPrTXBixh8Ade81SFK","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# 2026-04-14-1630-pingpong-mle-fold-buffers\n2\t\n3\tReplace per-round DeviceMatrix allocations in the constraints-phase MLE fold (`fold_mle_evals`) with pre-allocated contiguous ping-pong buffers. Currently, each MLE round allocates ~1400 new DeviceMatrix objects (one per foldable trace matrix across mat_evals and sels) and frees the previous round's ~1400 matrices, totaling ~37K cudaMallocAsync + ~37K cudaFreeAsync calls across 24 MLE rounds at APC 300. By pre-allocating two contiguous buffers (one for even rounds, one for odd) and computing per-trace offsets by halving the previous round's layout, we eliminate all per-round allocation/deallocation overhead (~15-20ms) while preserving the existing batched fold kernel.\n4\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e33616ae-361c-4ad4-bcb1-e94f2f710e44","uuid":"cfbbb3be-054a-45f0-b980-3eb4962e5f23","timestamp":"2026-04-14T15:40:30.202Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/georg/stark-backend/autoopt-results/task.md","content":"# 2026-04-14-1630-pingpong-mle-fold-buffers\n\nReplace per-round DeviceMatrix allocations in the constraints-phase MLE fold (`fold_mle_evals`) with pre-allocated contiguous ping-pong buffers. Currently, each MLE round allocates ~1400 new DeviceMatrix objects (one per foldable trace matrix across mat_evals and sels) and frees the previous round's ~1400 matrices, totaling ~37K cudaMallocAsync + ~37K cudaFreeAsync calls across 24 MLE rounds at APC 300. By pre-allocating two contiguous buffers (one for even rounds, one for odd) and computing per-trace offsets by halving the previous round's layout, we eliminate all per-round allocation/deallocation overhead (~15-20ms) while preserving the existing batched fold kernel.\n","numLines":4,"startLine":1,"totalLines":4}}}
