{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BUAV9oE559iRaoWZAyNDXs","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# 2026-04-14-1800-batch-mle-per-trace-h2d\n2\t\n3\tReplace per-trace `main_ptrs.to_device()` calls in MLE sumcheck round evaluation with per-round bulk H2D uploads. Currently, each MLE round builds a `Vec<MainMatrixPtrs>` for every Case B trace and uploads it individually, generating ~5000 H2D copies per segment (~10K total at APC 300). nsight profiling confirms the CUDA API overhead for these small transfers (~5μs each) consumes ~25ms per segment. By concatenating all per-trace MainMatrixPtrs into a single Vec and performing one bulk `to_device()` per round, we reduce ~10K H2D copies to ~48 (24 rounds × 2 segments), saving an estimated 40-50ms on MLE Rounds at APC 300.\n4\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01SNvxRv37zpqBNiVKojzG8X","session_id":"e33616ae-361c-4ad4-bcb1-e94f2f710e44","uuid":"e189dfbb-93b2-4a8e-8f3c-5fd0480edf20","timestamp":"2026-04-14T16:14:49.891Z"}
