{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VrUiafzvEjUJy4GCHjUbNU","type":"tool_result","content":"7\tpub fn eval_eq_mle<F1, F2, F3>(x: &[F1], y: &[F2]) -> F3\n8\twhere\n9\t    F1: Field,\n10\t    F2: Field,\n11\t    F3: Field,\n12\t    F1: Mul<F2, Output = F3>,\n13\t    F3: Sub<F1, Output = F3>,\n14\t    F3: Sub<F2, Output = F3>,\n15\t{\n16\t    debug_assert_eq!(x.len(), y.len());\n17\t    zip(x, y).fold(F3::ONE, |acc, (&x_i, &y_i)| {\n18\t        acc * (F3::ONE - y_i - x_i + (x_i * y_i).double())\n19\t    })\n20\t}\n21\t\n22\t/// Evaluate `mobius_eq_poly(u_tilde)` at an arbitrary point `x`.\n23\t///\n24\t/// ```text\n25\t/// mobius_eq_poly(u_tilde)(x) = ∏_i ((1 - 2*u_tilde_i) * (1 - x_i) + u_tilde_i * x_i)\n26\t/// ```\n27\tpub fn eval_mobius_eq_mle<F: Field>(u: &[F], x: &[F]) -> F {\n28\t    debug_assert_eq!(u.len(), x.len());\n29\t    zip(u, x).fold(F::ONE, |acc, (&u_i, &x_i)| {\n30\t        let w0 = F::ONE - u_i.double();\n31\t        acc * (w0 * (F::ONE - x_i) + u_i * x_i)\n32\t    })\n33\t}\n34\t\n35\t/// Evaluate the MLE defined by its hypercube evaluations at an arbitrary point, in place.\n36\t///"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01RAfV4P8puVUmVVW47UfM8T","session_id":"e33616ae-361c-4ad4-bcb1-e94f2f710e44","uuid":"24fd2c47-5b39-4dd0-863e-e2c9ace607fb","timestamp":"2026-04-14T16:37:30.398Z"}
